        <mxCell id="c19" value="&lt;b&gt;Sync&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;EventSyncManager: owner- and destination-bound SQLite outbox, data-generation fence, fall rows first. CadenceAPIClient (JWT in Keychain), BackendDiscovery (Bonjour)" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E0F2FE;strokeColor=#0369A1;fontColor=#0F172A;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=4;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="c4">
